2026-07-27T10:14:15.5650890Z i /tmp/RtmpoSXsZw/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:14:15.5651336Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:14:15.5651856Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:14:15.5652285Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:14:15.5653025Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:14:15.5654049Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:14:15.5655219Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
